('128.36.c.4.B',2,'A simplified version of a classic story helps a learner because it:','["adds math problems", "changes every character", "removes the plot", "keeps the story but uses easier language"]'::jsonb,3,'Adapted texts support understanding.','original'),
('128.36.c.4.C',2,'A heading tells a reader:','["what a section is about", "who printed the book", "the price", "how many pages remain"]'::jsonb,0,'Headings label sections.','original'),
('128.36.c.4.C',2,'A bold word in a paragraph often means:','["the word is wrong", "the word is important", "the word is silent", "the word is a name"]'::jsonb,1,'Fonts signal key words.','original'),
('128.36.c.4.D',3,'A photo and a paragraph describe the same event. A learner compares them to see:','["which is heavier", "which has more pages", "what each shows or tells differently", "which costs more"]'::jsonb,2,'Different forms present information differently.','original'),
