('128.36.c.6.G',2,'Which word order makes a correct English sentence?','["The dog chased the ball.", "Dog ball the chased.", "Ball the chased dog the.", "Chased the ball dog the."]'::jsonb,0,'English uses subject, verb, object order.','original'),
('128.36.c.6.G',2,'Arrange the words ''is / the / sky / blue'' into a sentence.','["Blue is sky the.", "The sky is blue.", "Sky blue is the.", "Is the blue sky."]'::jsonb,1,'The words form a correct pattern.','original'),
