('128.36.c.7.C',2,'Writing what you already know and what you still need to learn about a topic is:','["organizing questions for research", "finishing the project", "copying a paragraph", "drawing a border"]'::jsonb,0,'It plans inquiry.','original'),
('128.36.c.7.D',3,'A newspaper article and a TV report cover the same storm. A learner compares:','["the fonts of the titles", "how each tells about the event", "the weather forecast", "the paper prices"]'::jsonb,1,'Media present events differently.','original'),
('128.36.c.7.D',3,'Reading about an event online and watching a video of it lets a learner see:','["unrelated stories", "no details", "different ways the same event is shown", "the same words twice"]'::jsonb,2,'Comparing media shows variety.','original'),
